*.wasm
contracts/.contract-id-*
Cargo.lock
# The contracts workspace lockfile IS committed: soroban-env-host declares
# `ed25519-dalek = ">=2.0.0"`, so an unpinned CI resolve picks the
# API-incompatible 3.x and fails to build.
!contracts/Cargo.lock
build_errors*.txt
config.bat
